+### ASO controller pod fails to start when installed with Argo CD
+
+If you install ASO with Argo CD and the controller pod never becomes ready, check whether the
+`azureserviceoperator-manager-role` ClusterRole exists in the cluster. If it's missing, Argo CD was likely
+pointed at the chart source directory in the ASO git repository rather than at the Helm chart repository.
+The generated templates (including the ClusterRole) are only present in the packaged Helm chart.
+
+See [Installing with Argo CD](../installing-from-helm/#installing-with-argo-cd) for the correct configuration.
+
